Grammar

    0 $accept: program $end

    1 program: declarations functions main_function

    2 main_function: SANKALPA LPAREN RPAREN LBRACE statements RBRACE

    3 declarations: /* empty */
    4             | declarations declaration SEMICOLON

    5 declaration: type IDENTIFIER
    6            | type IDENTIFIER ASSIGN expression

    7 functions: /* empty */
    8          | functions function_declaration

    9 function_declaration: YAJNA type IDENTIFIER LPAREN parameters RPAREN LBRACE statements RBRACE

   10 parameters: /* empty */
   11           | parameter_list

   12 parameter_list: parameter
   13               | parameter_list COMMA parameter

   14 parameter: type IDENTIFIER

   15 statements: /* empty */
   16           | statements statement

   17 statement: declaration SEMICOLON
   18          | assignment SEMICOLON
   19          | conditional
   20          | loop
   21          | for_loop
   22          | TYAGA SEMICOLON
   23          | NIVRITTI SEMICOLON
   24          | function_call SEMICOLON
   25          | MOKSHA expression SEMICOLON
   26          | input_output SEMICOLON
   27          | try_catch_block

   28 try_catch_block: PRAYASCHITTA LBRACE statements RBRACE SHANTI LPAREN IDENTIFIER RPAREN LBRACE statements RBRACE

   29 assignment: IDENTIFIER ASSIGN expression

   30 conditional: DHARMA LPAREN expression RPAREN LBRACE statements RBRACE
   31            | DHARMA LPAREN expression RPAREN LBRACE statements RBRACE ADHARMA LPAREN expression RPAREN LBRACE statements RBRACE

   32 loop: TAPAS LPAREN expression RPAREN LBRACE statements RBRACE

   33 for_loop: YATRA LPAREN for_initialization SEMICOLON for_condition SEMICOLON for_increment RPAREN LBRACE statements RBRACE

   34 for_initialization: /* empty */
   35                   | assignment
   36                   | declaration

   37 for_condition: /* empty */
   38              | expression

   39 for_increment: /* empty */
   40              | assignment

   41 expression: term
   42           | expression YOGA term
   43           | expression VIYOGA term
   44           | expression VIBHAGA term
   45           | expression LT term
   46           | expression GT term
   47           | expression LE term
   48           | expression GE term
   49           | expression EQ term
   50           | expression NE term

   51 term: factor
   52     | term BAL factor
   53     | term VIBHAJAN factor
   54     | term SHESHA factor
   55     | term SAMAVAYA factor

   56 factor: LPAREN expression RPAREN
   57       | IDENTIFIER
   58       | literal
   59       | function_call

   60 literal: INTEGER_LITERAL
   61        | STRING_LITERAL
   62        | FLOAT_LITERAL

   63 function_call: AHVANA LPAREN arguments RPAREN

   64 arguments: /* empty */
   65          | argument_list

   66 argument_list: expression
   67              | argument_list COMMA expression

   68 input_output: SHRAVANA LPAREN IDENTIFIER RPAREN
   69             | MANTRA LPAREN expression RPAREN

   70 type: ARTHA
   71     | JALA
   72     | SATYA
   73     | AKSHARA
   74     | VANI


